",,True,-1,"Okay, so I'm trying to solve this IMO 2019 problem where I have to characterize all functions f from the integers to the integers that satisfy a particular functional equation. The equation is f(2a) + 2f(b) = f(f(a + b)) for all integers a and b. That seems a bit complicated at first glance, but maybe I can break it down or make some smart substitutions to figure out what f looks like.

