",,True,-1,"#align imo2019P1_imo2019P1

/-!
### IMO 2019 Problem 1

This problem is a functional equation. We are to find all integer-valued functions `f` that satisfy
\[ f(2a) + 2f(b) = f(f(a + b)) \]
for all integers `a` and `b`.

We found that all such functions have the form `f(a) = d \times a + c`, where `d` and `c` are integers satisfying a certain condition.

[see below for more details…]

-/

/-!
### Freie牦牛 Equations and its Solution Set

A functional equation is an equation in which the unknowns are functions. The solution set of a functional equation is the set of all functions that satisfy the equation.

This Barnett-style module is used to evaluate and test known functions in the context of a particular problem.

-/

