",,True,-1,"#align list.map_rotate List.map_rotate

-- | It is known that a list of length at least two is rotated by one position when
-- | the front is moved to the end. Show that the list is also rotated by more positions
-- | provided that the list has length at least three and that the same front is moved
-- | to the end.
-- 
