Substituting \( f(x) = a x + b \) into the original equation:
\[
f(x f(y) + f(x)) = x f(y) + \frac{2}{f(x)^2}
\]
Left-hand side (LHS):
\[
f(x f(y) + f(x)) = a (x f(y) + f(x)) + b = a x f(y) + a f(x) + b
\]
Right-hand side (RHS):
\[
x f(y) + \frac{2}{f(x)^2} = x f(y) + \frac{2}{(a x + b)^2}
